Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["\<\
This is meant to be the nb to see if we can generalize our action to describe \
the b-LRW. 
To make the Code leaner, I want to use a .m file with the definition of \
functions and then use a nb to \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]compile\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] it.\
\>", "Chapter",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.947661264236927*^9, 3.9476612939730053`*^9}, {
   3.9477503471432514`*^9, 3.9477503536948433`*^9}, {3.94790380136623*^9, 
