Cell["\<\
Note that the sum over all path (i.e. R->1) is equal to Z, thanks to the \
Viennot\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Theorem (this is also why I think that this static \
theory can indeed be constructed)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982053504471859*^9, 3.982053552171938*^9}, {
  3.9820535943247623`*^9, 
